# resume/ is DELIBERATELY TRACKED — read resume/README.md before adding an ignore here.
# It holds the master resume, its evidence ledgers, and per-application selections.
# Keep this repository PRIVATE: those files carry contact details, candid verification
# notes, and internals of a closed-source project.
# Nothing under resume/ reaches the built site — Astro builds src/ and public/ only, and
# the Pages workflow uploads dist/. Tracking it here does not publish it to the website.
